<title>POLAND: WARTA TO LIST 2.6 MLN SHARES JULY 22.</title>
<headline>WARTA TO LIST 2.6 MLN SHARES JULY 22.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish insurance firm Warta SA will list the 2.6 million shares from its February offering to five selected investors on July 22, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Warta currently has nearly 3.5 million shares in bourse trade.</p>
<p>The five selected investors included BPH and Kredyt Bank .</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
